<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Nehimiyakaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehimiyakaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehimiyakaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nehimiyakaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Maxaafi Nehimiyaki saseba qoodema dande'aani.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Yihuda galcho'a Faarsiki moyanji erigeeke Nehimiyaxxe akeekisanjummanni Iyyrussaalemika kinjiinka dalla'a qammachchine ijaarreexxa kulaake raagani; tenne waalini Nehmiyya manjuntenna adde haaronse'nashsha asseeni.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Mageniinke seerika Maxaafa Izira haaseessexxanna ard cubbo ifixxee adde ageexxa kuldaaxxe kutani.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Nehmiyya Yihudiinke galchanjo kade asseexxa wele hujuwwa kuldaaxxe kuttani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maxaaf giddo farri hite leellita'neexxi yaane Nehimiyya Magenoke'n afeemmaxxa jabaxxa addena Mageniinbaa soodateexxa soodachcho haaso'a'neeke raagani.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Moyanji Arixeksisi Nehmiya'a Iyyerussaalemi'a ergeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 1:1-2:10">1:1—2:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyyerussaalemiki kinjinki dalla'i qammalchemexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 2:1-4:22">2:1—4:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nehimiya hiyyeeyyete'e hedeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 5:1-19">5:1-19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Naaphi diina'naanni dalla'iinki ijaarsi muuxemeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 6:1-7:3">6:1—7:3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Booji'emeemmaki manni higeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 7:4-3">7:4—7:3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Izira Mageniinka seera ardakee haaseeseexxa, fooqiinka ayyananna ulfeessineexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 8:1-18">8:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ardi cubbote aadde ageexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 9:1-37">9:1-37</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mageniinke seeri'a ajajemo'a weli ange beessisa uggineexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 9:38-10:39">9:38—10:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihuda'ninna Iyerusalemike boga'ni ofo'leeka manna <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 11:1-36">11:1-36</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Booji'otenaa'n higgeexxa qeesolenna Leewito <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 12:1-26">12:1-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nehimiya qachchiinka dalla'a eebbisisseexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 8:1-10:39">8:1—10:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nehimiya asseexxa jijiirensha <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 11:1-13:31">11:1—13:31</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nehimiya Iyyerussaalemixxee'e Quuqemee qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Hakaaliyake beltika Nehimiyaka hiyyichcho.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Ani lame tomme wogga'n Kaasilu hinaake agenjo'n Suusake qachchi giddo hedhee'na'a, <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />anke dayyuwwi giddii'ni mitti Hanaani, wele henooke manninni welti Yihudaan ke'e dage; aninna Iyyerusaalemixxanna booji'emebaaki gateeke Yihudiinke mannixxa insa'nee qorenneni.<verse eid="NEH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Insa'nenna ani'a, «Booji'otenaa'n hafe gate'e ifike bogiba'a higeeki mann jabaaxxe rakko'ni ibe'e salphate hedheeni; Iyyerusaalemiki dalla'i diigeme lugge'eni; hulatike cufanuwa'ninna giira worreeni» hine.<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Ani tenne duuchcha laqennexxa yanna ofo'le oodhenneni; iimike Mageni edo heddo barra yaadenneni, agabo goddo soodatenneni. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma hiyyenne qici:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 1:5">«Ee iimike Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Mageno! Ati lumoken, no'onna ati edo soda'ati ati edo uurrinaannen; atinna ate'e eeyyaakenna ajaja atika ulfeessaake duuchchinn welti aaggettaxxa kako heqqexxatton, <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />ani erganji atiki ergataameeyye atixxee Isira'eelike ardixxee hashshanna barra ati edo soodataneexxa soodachcho laqi; ille atixxi anibaa uuddowwaali; no'o Isra'eelito cubbo hunje ate'e balleessineennaxxe'e aadde aangaanneni. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />No'o ate'n hara elobaaxxa fuggoxxa huje hunjeenneni; erganjo atike Muuse'a uutetteka ajaja, aadanna seera heqe'neebo'noni.<verse eid="NEH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />«Erganjo atike Muuse'a hitetteka hiyyichcho kassi hiyyi, ‹ha'no addatendineeke kada gophphinoole gosa gosake ard giddo ha'no xeerannoni, <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />anibaa higginolenna ajaja anika muuxxinoole shorremeemmaka arda ha'nooka buttatixxe gabala qico'n midde xeeremmoolenna, ookko'ninni insa'nee bukki assannoni; anike summinni ye'emo'a fi'lenneke boonchibaa insa'nee iyyedagannoni.›<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />«Kunni lumoxxe atixxe hunnanninna jabaxxe anga atixxenni anjirtetteke eriganjuwwaa atikenna arda atikenni. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Ee, Dada Duuchchike Gootta atike erganjixxa soodachcho; summa atika soodata'ni gammada'neeke erganjuwwi atikixxa soodachcho laqi. Konne manjichchi edo elle alfannoshsha telcho ani garbichchi atiki hujonnaa hedennexxi muuxxendaashsha assi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Ookkone wodda ani woyinetixxa booka moyanjoke ibisanakemani.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Arxekisiisi Nehimiya Iyyerusaalemi'a Me'o'yaa Eeti Uwwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Moyanji Arixxeekisiissi moyeexxe lame tomme wogga'n Niisaani hinaake agenjo'n woyinetixxi booka qophpheeseme wodda, woyyinnetixxa booka aadhe moyanjokee uuwenneni. Edi wodda alba anika himmi asse ege'nebo'noni. <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />Tennexxe moyanji, «Elagophpheboxxongi maye'e albi atiki gola'le? Tinni godobi giddo affeettexxe yaado male'e welechchobaani» anee hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Aninna yo'oshsha sodaateennani, <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />Aninna moyanjo, «Moyanjo duuchchi wodda moyi; annuwwa anika mongeeki qachchi diigemaa wodda, cufanuwwa giirati gunbaa wodda tennee uuda'ni hitta huqata gophanno?» isi'a hiyyenneni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:8-10">2 Moy. 25:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:19">2 Odo. 36:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:12-14">Erm. 52:12-14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Moyanjiikinna «Ati maachcho hassaatteta?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Ookkoneechchi uduma aninna iimike Mageniinbaa soodatenneni; <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />Aninna moyanjoke, «Ati moyanjo eetaattexxee kaddoolenna erganji atiki ani ati edo eyyemennexxe kaddoole, haaroba qammalche ijaaronnaa annuwwa anika moongemmake Yihudiinke qachchibaa me'onnaa eeti ani'a uwwi» hiyyenneni.<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Ookkone wodda, moyanji isi bira ofoldeexxe motitte ifixxini welti hedheexxi, «Ori me'e barra me'isaake? Haano higge daggatto?» hiyye anee qore. Moyanjikinna me'annoxxa eeyye; aninna haano higannoxxa iso'ni kulenneni.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Aninna isi'a hiyyennee qici, «Moyanjo eetaattole, Yihudiinka boga geyanno qico'ni nage'iki ane'e sa'issinaasha Efiraaxisi wido boga galcha'neeke galchanjuwwi'a borreessa borreesite ani'a uwwi. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Ittanni moyanjiinka gongoma heqqaammake Asaafi'a, galmini bira hedheeke kinjiinke dalla'ixxe huluwwaa, qachchiinke dalla'uwwi'aana aninna hedhannoke mini'a ijaarsake'e kaddaaxxa haqqe, ani'a uwwendaashsha borro ani'a borreessi» Elooxxi anike Magenixxi anga aninni hexxemmaxxe moyanji ani'a eeti uwwe. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Tennexxee Efiraaxisi wido hedheeke boga galchaammakiriba'a mare'e moyanjiinxa borruwwa uwwenneni; moyanjikinna loliinke mannika akekisanjuwwanna fadhado gulufaammaki manninna aninni welti me'aashsha asse.<verse eid="NEH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Horoonki Senbalaaxinna Amoonik erganji Xoobiya tennee lanqeexxa yanna Isira'eelike nage'i'a hedaaki manji dageexxee yo'oshsha aarre.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehimiya Iyyerusaalemika Dalla'uwwa mammareme Uude</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Aninna Iyyerusaalemi'a me'enneni; ookkonna sase barra turenelchi uduma, <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />aninna heenoke manninni welti hashsha fulenneni. Iyyerusaalemi'a assannoxxa Mageni qalbe anxi giddo uggeexxa yaane ayye'ninna kulebo'noni; gulufennexxa gaange malee'e weliichchi hedhemmabaani.<verse eid="NEH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Ani hashsha fulennexxi dhooqatixxe hula darre'n dhudhdhuufiinxe wodi'inxe balebaa'ni kora hunnamaxxe hulaba'a marenneni; diigemeeka Iyyerusaalemika dalla'uwwanna giira itte birteeka cufanuwwa uudenneni. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Ookko'ninna wodi'inxe muummeexxee hulabaanna moyanjiinke baleessibaa marenneni; kaddo malee gulufennexxi gaange saxxaaki boonchi hedhemmabani. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Tennexxe dalla'a uuda'n hashsha dhooqa sa'ennexxi alalle qabatenneni; udumi'anna wirri hiyye higennexxi Dhooqatixxe Hula darree'n e'yenneni. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Yihudake, yookaani qeesetee, yookaani Ja'labuwwakee yookaani Jaliqabuwwakee huje hujaammakee mannaa mittilchi haaso'ennechchi hedha gophpheemmaxxee'e; haba me'ennexxa yookaani maa asseennexxa Jalqabuwwi ege'nebaani.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Aninna insa'ne'a, «Anfennexxa rakko kunn uddina'neeni; Iyyerusaalemi diigendeeni; cufanuwwakanna giira itte birteeni; ta'a amme Iyyerussaalemika dalla'a haaroba ijaarro; yooni oso'lemmabo'noshsha» insa'ne'a hiyyenneni. <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Ittanni eloke anike Magenixxi anga aninni hexxeexxanna moyanjikinna ani'a hiyyeexxa insa'ne'a kulenneni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Insa'nenna «Amme haaroba qammalchine ijaarro» hineechchi uduma tenne eloxxa huje hujete'n ke'ne.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Yaane kinn Horoonaki Sanbalaaxi, Amoonitotik erganji Xoobiyanna Arabiki Gesheemi tenne lanqeexxi no'o cee'mina'ni tuffante; iittaanni, «Kunn hujjina'neechchi maachcho? Moyanjoke'n fuggoxxini kexxino'a hassina'ne?» hine.<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Aninna insa'ne'a, «Iimiki Mageni no'o'a muxxaani; no'o isiki erganjuwwi hujete'e ke'naanneni; ha'no kinn Iyyerusaalemi'n qoobbi yookaani no'o'a hasisaani hitinaachchi yookaani kassi assaaka raaga affinebaani» hiyye insa'ne'a hiissenneni.<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Dalla'a Hiisse Ijareeka Hujalluwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Qeesetiki akekisanji Eliyaashibinna qeeseti dayyuwwi isiki hujete'e ke'ne; Gedhebiinxe Hula hiyyemaaka haaroba qammalchine ijaarre. Woyyoonsine; cufanuwwakanna bakka bakka'ninni uurrinse. Dhibba xelleephpho hinaaka kinjinka dalla'anna Hanaani'eelixxe xelleephpho hinamma boonchi qico'n hunjeexxi woyyoonsine. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Ookko'n itti aancheexxi Iyyaarikoki manni ijaare; insa'neeke'n itti aanche higgeeni Imeerik belti Zekkuri ijaare.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Qulxu'metixxe Hula hinaaba Haasina'ixxi oose ijaarte; insa'neenna utuphuwwwa uurrinseexxi cufanuwwa, danqarisanjuwwakanna maaxxafuwa booncho booncho'ninni assine. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Haqoosike beltik belti Uuriyaki belti Meeriimoti ookko'ni itti anaaka dalla'a qammalche. Iso'n itti aandaxxa Meseezeebeliki akka'i Berraakiyaki belti Mesulaami qammachche ijaare. Iso'ni itti andaaxxa Be'aanaki belti Saadoqi qamalchine ijaare. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Itti aanaaka dalla'a Teequhaki manni qammalche; Ja'labuwwi insa'neeki kinn hujisaammake manni hunda he'ne hunjo'a eenebaani.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Dullatte Hula Fasehaki belti Yoodaahenna Beesoodiyaaki belti Mesulaami qammachchine; insa'nenna utuphuwwa uurrinseexxi cufanuwwa, abixxinaammalchonna danqarisanjuwwa booncho booncho'ninni assine. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Insa'ne'n itti aancheexxi qammachchatixxa huje hujeeki Efiraaxisi wido hedheeke galchanji hunda he'neki Yaadoniki Gaba'oonikenna Mitsiphphake manni Geba'oonike Meliixiyanna Meroonotawike Beyyaadoninitemmani. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Worqe baqisammakri giddii'n mitti Haarihayaki belti Uzi'eeli itti aanaaka dalla'a qammalche; shitto giisaammakiri gidi'n mitti Hanaaniya kinn ookko'ni itti aancheexxi qammalchine. Insa'nenna «Ba'lake Dalla'a» hinaammake boonchi qico'ni Iyyerusaalemi qammalchine. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Ookko'n itti aandaaxxa Iyyerusaalemika awuraajja gamisa galchaammaki Huuriki belti Refaaya qammalche. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Harumaafiki belti Yidaaya mini isiki edidarre hedheeka dalla'a qammalche; Hashabeniyaki belti Haxxuusi kinni itti aandaaxxa qammalche. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Hariimiki belti Melikiyaanna Fehaatimabiki belti Hashuubi wele dalla'uwwanna Laangotixxe giiraxxa Xelleephpho qammalche. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Iyyerusaalemika awuraajja gamisa galchaammaki Haloheeshek belti Shaaloomi dubarri ifikinni welti itti aandaaxxa kutta qammalche.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />«Dhooqatixxe Hula» hinaaba Hanooninna Zaanohi hedhaammaka qammalchine; cufanuwwakanna booncho booncho'ninni uurrinse; maxaafuwwakanna danqarisanjuwwa giissine; ittanni «Kora hunaaxxe Hula» hinaake boonchi qico'n hexxeexxa mitte kuma ciqile dalla'a qammalchine.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />«Kora hunnaaxxe Hula» hinaaba Beetihakaremika boga galchaammaki Rekaabiki belti Melikiya qammalcheechchi uduma cufanuwwa, maaxafuwwakanna danqarisanjuwwa booncho booncho'ninni aase.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Mitsiphphaka boga galchaammaki Kolihaazeki belti Seloomi, «Muummetixxe Hula» hinaaba qammalchechchi uduma cufeexxi cufanuwwa booncho booncho'ninni aasse; maaxafuwwakanna danqarisanjuwwa giisse. «Moyanjiinke hiddichchiinke fichcha» hinaa bira hedheeka Sheelake baleessika dalla'a gamii'ni Daawwitike qachchana'ni ke'isse adadde dirrinammaxxe koobbo qico'n higgeenni qammalche. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Isi udumi'n Beetitsurike rogika gamisa galchaammaki Azibeeqiki belti Nehimiya Daawwitike hirreessi edigama konfeemmaka balleessanna «Jannuwiinke mine» hinaake boonchi qico'n hedheeka qammalche ijaare.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dalla'iinxe Huje'ni Bobbaateexxa Leewito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Iso'ni itti aanche Leewwichchi Baaniki belti Reehuumi akeekaa'na qammalchine ijaarre. Itti aanchexxi Oi'iilaka awuraajja gamisa galchaammaki Hashabiya gateeka dalla'a qammalchine. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Iso'n itti aaneeka dalla'a kinn weli Qi'iilake awuraajjika gamisa galchaammaki Henadaadiki belti Baawayinna isi galchaammake boga ookkoneki mann qammalche. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Iso'n itti aaneexxi loliinka miya massinaammake minibaa gesisaammakanna kasiinbaa me'inaamma edi darre hedheeka wele dalla'a Mitsiphpha galchaammaki Iyyaasuki belti Eetsiri qammalche ijaare. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Iso'n itti aaneexxi Zabayiki belti Baarooki kasakenaa'n ke'isseexxi qeesetike akeekisanjike Eliyaashibike minibaa e'yinamma qico'ni hedheeka wele dalla'a jabaate qammalche ijaare. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Iso'n itti aancheexxi Eliyaashibike minibaa e'yinammabaa'n ke'isseexxi muuxamini qico'n hedheeka wele dalla'a Haqoosike beltik belti Uuriyaki belti Meriimooti qammalche.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dalla'iinxe Huje'ni Bobbaateexxa Qeese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Iso'n itti aane'e hedheeka dalla'a qarqarakenaa'n daggeexxi qeese qammalchite. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Insa'ne'n itti aanchineexxi Biiniyaaminna Hassuubi mini edi darre hedheeka dalla'a qammalche.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 3:23">Insa'ne'n itti aanchexexi Hananiyaki aka'i Me'iseeyaki belti Azaariya mini isiki bira hedheeka dalla'a qamachche ijaare. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Iso'n itti aancheexxi Azaariyake minibaa'n ke'isseexxi kasin qico'ninna kasiinxe qacce qico'n hedheeka dalla'a Henadaadiki belti Biiniwwi qammalche. <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />Uuzayik belti Falaali dala'inke kasi edigamii'n heqaqnji heqqaammake ba'linni bira hedheeke iimi darreka galchatika mine heqinaammake kinjiinke dalla'ibaa'n ke'isse hedheeka dalla'a qammalche ijaare. Iso'n itti aancheexxi Faarosiki belti Fadayanna, <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />Oofeeli hinaake tullichcha'ni hedha'neeki galmiinki erganjuwwi «Wodi'iinxe Hula» hina edigami'ni ke'ise boroti darree'n hedheeke kinjiinxe xelleephpho qico'n qammalche.<verse eid="NEH 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hujete'ni Bobba'eeka Wele Dalla'a Ijaaraaka Manna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Insa'ne'n itti aancheexxi Teequ'aki manni xelleephpho qico'ni Oofeeli hedheeka wele dalla'a qammalchine.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />«Fadhadiinxe Hula» hinamma iimi darre hedheeka kinni qeese mitte mittendi mini ifi ifiki edidarre hedheeka qammalchite ijaarte. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Insa'ne'n itti aancheexxi Imeerik belti Saadooqi mini ifiki edi darre hedheeka qammalche ijaare. Iso'ni itti aancheexxi «Borotixxa Hula» heqqaammaki Sekeenyaki belti Shemaya qammalche ijaare. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Iso'ni itti aanaaka wele dalla'a kinn Selemiyaki belti Hanaaniyanna Seleefiki jiyaba ilemeeki belti Hanooni qammalchine ijaarre. Insa'ne'n itti ancheexxi Berraakiyaki belti Mesulaami mini isiki edidarre hedheeka qammalche ijaare. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Iso'n itti aancheexxi worqe baqisammake mannanaa'n mitti Meelikiya fattanshammaxxe hula edigama hedheeke galmiinke erganjuwwikenna daddalanotike mini qico'n, ittanni kasi iimi darre hexxeexxe kuta qico'n hedheeka qammalche. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Kasi iimi darree hexxeexxe kutabaa'n ke'isse Gedhebiinxe Hula qico'n hedheeka kinn worqe baqisammakirinna daddalanno qammalchinee.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nehimiya Huje Isixxe'ni Ke'eeka Diina Injifate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Senbalaaxi dalla'a qammalchine ijaarra'neexxa laqeexxa yanna aare; yo'oshshanna mufate. Isinna yihudoota cee'me. <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />Jaaluwwi isiki edonna Semaariyake loliinke manni edo «Kunni hunna afebaaki yihudooti maa asso'a hedee? Dalla'uwwa qammalche ijaaro'ate? Tolcha shiqinsho'aate? Mitte barra'ni ijaarre birro'aate? Iitta gubate oletishsha tuulendeexxa kino hiissa dandeenno'aate?» hiyye.<verse eid="NEH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Isi bira uurreemmaki Amoonichchi Xoobiya, «Isi insa'ne ijaarra'neechchi maachcho? Insa'ne kinjiki ijaarra'neeki dalla'i jeedali midde da'moole diigemaaken» hiyye.<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Ee, Mageno no'okee, tuffatensha no'oxxa laqi; no'o arrassina'neeki arrabi insa'ne'ni higgaashsha assi; insa'nenna booji'emme me'ineeke boga'ni doosa kiyya hinaashsha assi. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Diigemeemmaka qammalchate'n hedheeka manna yowwineemmaxxee balleessa insa'neexxa gattowwaali hitoxxe; cubbo insa'neexxanna deetoxxe.<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Ardi mitte godobinni hujaammaxxe'e, no'onna dalla'a gamisin qico qammalchinenneni.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Senbalaaxi, Xoobiya, Araabito, Amoonito Ashidoodiki manni; Iyyerusaalemike dalla'ixxi huje muddamiki hujemate'ni hexxeexxanna duwwika booncho duuchcha wonshate'ni he'neexxa lanqeexxa yanna yo'oshsha mufante. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Insa'nenna Iyyerussaalemi'i lollo'anna rakkisate'e duuchchiingi mitteba guddine. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />No'o kinn no'oke Mageniba'a soodantenne; hashshanna barra afo'o fulchedha'ni sodaachisaaka manna ugginenneni.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Ookkone wodda Yihudaki ardinna, «Hujaammaki manninna hunna gopheen; tulendeexxi ole birasaxxeemmaxxe'e dalla'a qammalchine ijara dandeenaabo'noni» hiyye.<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Naaphuwwi no'oki kinn «Oddo insa'neexxe'ni e'yine insa'ne shinnanno qico'ni huje insa'neexxa uurrinsaanno qico'ni egennabaani yookaani anfabaani» hiyye.<verse eid="NEH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'neek qarqara'ni hedhaemmaki Ayihudooti dageexxi, «Ha'no hoone booncho'ninna hexxinoole; insa'ne no'o lolle miidha gattabaani» hine tommele lenbe lenbe no'o'a kulle.<verse eid="NEH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Tennexxe dalla'i uduma aadi darrre hedhek farri hiyyeeke booncho'ni ardi giddii'ni mitti mitti ifika wolaantichcha, bageduwwakanna gabuwwa abixxeeshshanni ifi ifike mini hadinni booncho abixxaashsha assenneni.<verse eid="NEH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Aninna yaane kokeessedhe uudennelchchi uduma Ja'laabuwwa, Jalqabuwwakanna gateeka arda duuchhca, «Insa'nee sodaattinoqqe'e; lummedheekanna sodaatemeeka Dada Duuchchika Gootta hedde; dayyuwa ha'nookixxee, labbaxxenna meyyaxxe oose ha'nooxxee, aruwa ha'nooxxeenna mine ha'nookeenna karra ha'nooxxe'e lolle» insa'ne'a hiyyenneni.<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Naaphuwwi no'ok gudda guddeemmaka egenneennaxxee Mageni heduma insa'neeka toliinke asseexxa insa'ne lanqee wodda no'o duuchchiingi dalla'iinxe hujeba'a, mitti mittingi ifi ifixxe hujeba'a hingenneni.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Ettene barranaa'n ke'isse anke manni giddii'ni gamisi huje hujaamman; gateeki kinni wontenna bagedo, gabetanna loliinxa seemma abixeemman. Loliinke mannik akeekisanjuwwi Yihudiink ardi duuchchi uduma uurre; <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />insa'nenna dalla'a ijaadhineemman; miya ba'edhaammaki manni mitte anganni huje hunja'ni; wele angani loliinka miya abixxineemmani. <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />Mitti mittingi kinjiinka dalla'a ijaadhdha wodda wolaantichcha hidhake'n ka'leemmani; malagata ufuufaammaki manjichchi kinn ani birii'ni gargari higaammabaani.<verse eid="NEH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Ja'labuwwakee, Jaliqabuwwakeena gateeke ardi'a hiyyennee qici, «Dallaliinxi huje lumooxxenna ba'laxxe kaddeemmaxxe'e no'onna welina'ni yo'oshsha bayyantee he'nenneni. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Ha'nonna malagatiinka hafuura laqqina wodda, no'oba'a bukki hiyye. Mageni no'oki no'o'a lolaani» hiyyenneni.<verse eid="NEH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Tennexxe boro haachchabbaaxxe yannanaa'n ke'isse urje fuldaa qico'n gamisi manni bagedo ifika abixeeshshanni huje sannfenneni. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Ookkone wodda arda ifikee hiyyee qici, «Hashsha heqqa'ninna barra huje huja'ni no'oo gargaaraashsha mitti mitti manji ifike gargaarsanjinni Iyyerusaalemi turowwaali» insa'ne'a hiyyeneni. <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Anttenna kadi aniki dayyuwwi, mannakeenna kado'o aninni welti hedheemmaki heqqanjuwwi seemma no'oxxa fulche'nebo'noni; wode'e me'inanno wodda midde mitti mittingi manji loliinka miya abixxinennashshanni he'nennani.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nehimiya Hiyyeeyye Gargaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Ookkone wodda labballikinna aruwwa insa'neexxi Ayihudiinke ifike dayyuwwibaa ku'lat jaba qicinni cancine. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Mitti mittingi «No'onna kadi labbaxxinna meyyaxxe no'oxxe ooseki laakkossi heddokeni; hedhoti he'nannoshsha ita no'o'a hasissaani» hine.<verse eid="NEH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Weli manni hiyyee qici, «Solo'i no'o'ni itti jabaateemma wodda midha alfinnonaa hine boga no'oka, woyinetike hiddichchika fichchanna minuwa no'oka abidinsenneni» hine.<verse eid="NEH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Weli manninna hiyyee qici, «Fichchuwwa no'okanna woyinetike hiddichika fichcha irbo moyanjokee uunonna'a maallaqa liqeesse'nanno qico'ni» genneenneni. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Fedheexxenna kaddoole midde bogi no'okike manninni welti mitte maalanna mitte munde kandonnolenna; insa'neexxe ooseshshanni no'oxxi labbaxxi oose danchate kaddoolenna; labbaxxanna meyyaxxa no'oxxa oose garbake kando'a uunenneni; mitte mitte meyyaxxi no'oxxi oose ta'anna garbake kadde'eni; fichcha no'okanna woyinetika hiddichcho no'oka weli manni adhdheemmaxxee gophaaleeyyete kandeenneni.<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Aninna raare insa'neexxanna tenne ku'linneexxa ku'la laqennexxa yanna yo'oshsha aarenneni. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma yaane tennee hede uudennelchchi uduma Ja'laabuwwakanna Jalqabuwwa hiyyennee qici: «Ha'noonna ha'noonge mannanaa'ni hitta dhala adhdhitina!» hiyye insa'ne xixenneni. Tennexxee insa'nenni welti haaso'atee yo'oka manna bukki assenneni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:25">Fula. 22:25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:35-37">Lew. 25:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:19-20">Lew. 23:19-20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />Aninna «Gosa gosake ardi'a guriguremeemaka dayyuwwa no'oka Ayihudoota dandeenneenne qico insa'nee anjirennen; ha'no kinni dayyuwwa ha'nooka gurgurtinaani; tinninna insa'nee hiisine anjirronna callaten!» aninna insa'ne'e hiyyennen insa'nenna hinaaxxa gonphe sammi hine.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Tennexxe higgeenni hiyyennee qici, «Tinni assitina'neexxi yaane eloxxebaani; naaphuwwi no'oki gosa gosak ardi no'oo yowwabaashsha Mageno no'oka sodaata ha'no'a hasisaaba? <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Ani, aniki dayyuwwinna aniki erganjuwwi ittani ardake mallaqakanna midha liqeessineenneni; dhala adhdhinabo'no. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Fichchuwwa insa'neeka, woyinetikanna ejersiinxe zayiteka hiddichchiinka fichchuwwanna minuwwa insa'neeka duuchcha ta'anni rakkine hiisse; ittanni midha, haaroka woyintika bulbulo insa'neeka, ejersiinxa zayite, adhdhitineemmaka maallaqa insa'nee'a hiisse.»<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Insa'nenna, «Hiissinannoni; mittelchonna insa'nenaa'n dhala lanqabo'no; ati no'o'a hitetteshshaanni assinannoni» hine. Qeesetanna ye'e'neeni; Ja'laabuwwinna Jaliqabuwwi hineemmaka hiyyichcho muunxaashsha kakachiisenneni. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Ittanni ani fiyisanjonna aadhe seemma anxa fiyennexxi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayihudiinke galduma'ni seema fiyate hiyya aangeexxa koka heqqecca leellishatike beesisan. </char></note> «Konnee addetika hiyyichcho muuxabaaka fedheeka manjo Mageni mine isikanna karra isixxa iitta fiyowwaal; ittanni duwwi gatowwaali» hiyyenneni. Ookko hedheemmaki ya'i duuchchi «Ameen» hiyyeexxi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta galateeffate; ardkinna hiyyeemmaka hiyyichcho muuxxe.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehimiya Ifi Calla Eeyyabake Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Konneechchi iimi darre ani Yihudiinka boga galchannoshsha hariiremennelchinni; Arixxeekisiissi moyexxe lame tomme wogganaa'ni ke'isse; sase tommenna lame wogga mootummatike bari qico'n, aninna dayyuwwi aniki tommenna lame wogga qico'n boga galchaammakee uunaammaxa ita adhdhine indebe'noni. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Ani edigama hedheemmaki ediki galchanjuwwi kinn itanna woyinetika bulbulo waalini ardake'ni jabaxxa ba'o ba'isati shoole tomme birreti sibljo adhdha'nemmani; insa'nee gargaaraammakiri iittanni ardake'n ba'o ba'isa'nemmani. Ani kinni Mageno sodaatatenaa'ni kexxeexxa iitta hexxexxa yaane assebo'noni. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Iitta assati irra ani dalla'inxe huje'a ifi sa'isse uwwenneni. Anki manni duuchchi hujete'e ookko'o bukki hiyyeemmani; no'onna mittelchonna boga anfeennabaani.<verse eid="NEH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Konneechchi iimi darre qarqara no'okibaa'a dageemmake gosa gosake ardi gadho mitte dhibbanna onde tommi Yihudiinki manninna Jalqabuwwi qore anxenaa'ni inda'nemmani. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Barra barra'ninni mitte jibichcha, jaane ha'yeeki gedhdhebinna heddo lukko tomme tomme barra'n heddo gargaritti hedheeka woyinetika bulbulo ani'a qophphessina'nemmani. Tinn duuchcha kadda'naani mitte boga galchaake manji'a hasissaxxa ita hara laqe ege'nebo'noni. Yaane kinni ardake'ni ba'iseexxa ba'o ani ege'neennaxxeeten. <verse eid="NEH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Ee, anike Mageno, konne ardi'a assennexxa duuchcha heddettexxi eloxxa an'a assi.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Dalla'i Hujemabaashsha Assemeeka Diina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Eettene yanna qico'ni hulate'ni cufanuwwa aassa gophonnolenna, dalla'a ijaare muuxennaxxenna gateeki duwwiki boonchi hedhebaaxxa Senbalaaxi, Xoobiya. Arabichchi Gesheeminna weli gateemmaki naaphuwwi no'oki midde laqeexxa yanna; <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Senbalaaxinna Gesheemi, «Oono hiyyemaake dida'n hedheeke olla'uwwi giddii'ni mitteke'ni afemonna'a amo hine dhaansa ergine.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:2">Yaane kinni insa'ne tenne assine'ek ane'e fuggo miino'a hendeetemman. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Aninna «Jabaxxa huje hujate'ni hedheennaxxe ha'no hexxineeke boonchiba'a daga dande'aabo'noni; waale ha'nooba'a dagee'na huje mayee'e uurrita?» hitaaxxa hiissa insa'ne'a gulaaka erganjuwwa insa'ne'n ergenneni.<verse eid="NEH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Shoole yanna tenne bifaxxa erga aniba'a ergine; aninna mitte mitte yanna'ninni etteneenni hiissa insa'ne'a hiissenneni.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Senbalaaxinna edi woddishshanni erganjo ondixxe yanna'a aniba erge; ergememmaki borreessi hyyamma qici: <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />«Atinna Ayihudik ardi jallote'e mari'atina'neexxanna dalla'a ijartina'neexxa ardi giddo haaso'endeeni; Geeseminna dhugaate kaddeexxa kokeen; higgeenna haso'endemmashshanni ati insa'neeke moyanjo kaddaattexxa, <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />atixxe'ee ‹Yihudi giddo moyanji hedheeni› hine Iyyerusaalemi giddo lallabbaaxxa wabeeko midde harirtettexxa haaso'endeeni. Tinni yaanenna moyanjoke'ni geltebaaki gattabaani; tennexxe dagge'naa'a atinni tenne yaanexxee mari'antennele eloxxen» hitaaxxemman.<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Aninna, «Ati hitaattexxa fakkattaaxxi mittetinna assendeexxi yanenna hexxebani; tinni ati heduma atikenni assitettexxen» hiyye iso'ni hiisse ergenne.<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Duuchchiingi, «Anga insa'neexxi huja gophphaa qico'ni shaqqitaani; hujetinna muuxxendebaangi gattaani» hine hendeexxi no'oo sodaachchinso'a wo'laaneen. Ani kinn «Ta'anna anga anxa jabeessi» hiyye Mageno soodatenneni.<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Mitte barra mine iso'n cufemenaa'a giddo hedheemmake Delaaya Mexaabi'eelikika belto Shamyaba marenne; isinna ane'e «Manni ate shiyo'a dagaammaxxee, dhugaanden hashsha ate'e shiyo'a dagaammaxxe Mageniinke mine'n galmi gido afemmo; galmiinxa hulanna cunfo» hiyye.<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Aninna knn, «Anishsha hedheeki manji baqate sho'omaa? Yookaani lubbo gatonna'a hiyye galmi giddi'a e'ya hasissa? Hiyye me'abo'noni!» hiyyenneni. <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Ane'n wabeekumma haasonneeki Xoobiyanna Senbalaaxi maallaqiki hireemeete male'e Mageni aniba'a ergeeke manna kadebaaxxa ege'neenneni. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Maallaqiki hiremeemmaki ane'e sodachchisateeteni; tennee assiyyot ane'e cubbote'n ibiseexxi summa anka balleessat mannake'n gibemannoshsha assateeteni.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Aninna «Anke Mageno, Xoobiyyanna Senbalaaxi hunjeexxa huje uudi; anee sodaachchiso'a wo'landeexxa wabeeko No'adiyya hiyyendeexxa wabeeko uudi» hiyye soodatenne.<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dala'iinxe Hujexxa Muuxensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Dalla'iinki ijaarsinna Eluli hiyyemaake agenjixxe lame tommenna ondde barra'n, onde tommena lame barra giddo muuxeme. <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Qarqara no'oke'n hedheeki naphuwwi no'ok gosa gosaki ard duuchchi tennee laqee woda sodaate; ifi saadatanna dandeenneba'a; tinni kaddeechchi tinni huje Mageniinke gargarsinni hujendeexxa egennemmaxxeeteni.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Ookkone wodda Yihudiinki Ja'laabuwwi Xoobiya'a heddo borreessa erga'nemmani; Xoobbiyanna hiisseexxi insa'ne'a erga'nemmani. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Yihudiinki bogi giddo hedha'neek heddi manninna isixxe gamo kade kakateeman; tinninna kaddeechchi Eeraki belti Sekeeniyake ballo kadati iimi darre isiki belti Hoohanaani Leerakiyaanixxa meyyaxxa belto adhdheemmaxxeeteni. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Tenne'ninni hana eloxxa isixxa huje yanna yanna'ni ane'n kulla'n aninna hiyyenneexxa iso'n kula'nemmani; Xoobiyanna anee sodaachchisatee borreessa ane'n erga'nemmani.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Dalla'i qammachcheme luge'naa cufanuwwakanna booncho booncho'n uurrisennechchi uduma, hula heqqaakara, faarsaaleyyenna Leewwito booncho uwwemme. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Iyyerusaalemi giddo dayyo anka Hanaani'i ittan addatemeekanna wele manni irra Mageno yo'oshsha soddaataaka dalla'iinka ajajallo Hanaanina galchalluwwake asse balloonssenne. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Aninna insa'ne'anna, «Iyyerusaalemixxa huluwwa arishsho eebitaa qico'n banendoqqe'e; hula heqqaammaki heqqanjuwwi heqqaa wodda duuchcha, huluwwa cufowwaali; danqarisanjuwwikinna danqarowwaali; ittanni Iyyerussaalemi hedheeka manna mitte mitte heqqatike bonchcho'n; mitti mitte ifi ifi bira heqqaashsha ugge» hiyyenneni.<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Booji'otenaa'n Higeeke Mannika Summuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Qachchi lumokenna ba'lakemmani; isi giddo hedhaammaki ardi kinn heenoke kada wodda, minuwwi qamalchemeemmaba'a. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Tennexxe Ja'laabuwwa, ulfaateeka arda bukki asse'e mini mini ifikenni borreessemmaashsha Mageni qalbe anixxe'n ugge. Bogi ifikiba'a higati siretike kadeeke mannixxe illatike daalixxa borreessa afenneni; borreesendee'naa afennexxi borreessanna konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxeni.<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Baabiloonik moyanji Naabukedenetsoori booji'e adhdhe me'emmaki boga ifikiba'a higeemmaki manni konneechchi butti'a hedheekeni: mitti mittingi Iyyerusaaleminna Yihudake'n afemaake ifi ifinge qachchibaa hige. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Hingeekiirinna Zerubaabelini, Iyyaasunni, Nehimiyanni, Azaariyaasinni, Re'amiyanni, Nehaamani, Meridokisinni, Bilishaaninni, Mispheereetinni, Bigiwwayinni, Nehuuminaaninna Be'aannanni weltiteni.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:7" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Isira'eelike manniki laakkosi.<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Faaroosixxe hortenaa'n 2,172 <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Sefaaxiyaasixxe sannenaa'n 373 <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Arahexxe sannena'n 652 <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Iyyasuxxenna Iyyo'aabixxe sanne kandeeki Fehaati Mo'aabixxi daalinaa'n <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Eelaamixxe sannenaa'n 1, 254 <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Zaatu'ixxe sannenaa'n 845 <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Zekkayixxe sannenaa'n 760 <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Biiniwwixxe sannenaa'n 648 <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Bebaayixxe sannenaa'n 628 <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Azigaadixxe sannenaa'n 2, 322 <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Adooniqaamixxe sannenaa'n 667 <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Bigiwwaxxe sannenaa'n 2,067 <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Adiinixxe sannenaa'n 655 <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Hiziqiyaasike daal'n Axeerixxe hortenaa'n 98 <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Hashuumixxe sannenaa'n 328 <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Bedaayixxe sannenaa'n 324 <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Hariifixxe sannenaa'n 112 <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Geba'oonixxe sannenaa'n 95 <verse eid="NEH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Beetelihemi'ninna Nexoofake Mannanaa'ni 188 <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Anaatootike mannanaa'n 128 <verse eid="NEH 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Beeti Azimootike mannanaa'n 42 <verse eid="NEH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Qiriyatiyi'aarimike, Kefiranna Be'eerotike mannanaa'n 743 <verse eid="NEH 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Raamakenna Geba'ike mannanaa'n 621 <verse eid="NEH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Maakimaasike mannanaa'n 122 <verse eid="NEH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Beeti'eelikinna Gayike mannanaa'n 123 <verse eid="NEH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Wele Naabawike mannanaa'n 52 <verse eid="NEH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />Wele Elaamixxe sannenaa'n 1, 254 <verse eid="NEH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Hariimixxe sannenaa'n 320 <verse eid="NEH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Iyyaarikoxxe sannenaa'n 345 <verse eid="NEH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Loodixxe, Hadaadixxenna Oonoxxe sannenaa'n 721 <verse eid="NEH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Sena'axxe sannenaa'n 3, 930.<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Qeese Iyyaasuke mini hadid darree'n Yooda'iyaxxe sannenaa'n 973 <verse eid="NEH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Imeerixxe gosanaa'n 1,052 <verse eid="NEH 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Faskoorixxe sannenaa'n 1,247 <verse eid="NEH 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Hariimixxe sannenaa'n 1,017 <verse eid="NEH 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Leewwito, Qadimi'eeli gamanaa'n Hodaawiyaxxe horte gami'n Iyyaasuxxe sannenaa'n 74 <verse eid="NEH 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Faarsaaleyye, Asaafixxe sannenaa'n 148 <verse eid="NEH 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Hulatika heqqanjuwwa, Seloomixxe, Axeerixxe, Xalmoonixxe, Aquubixxe, Haxiixaxxenna Sobaayixxe sannuwwanaa'ni 138 <verse eid="NEH 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Galmiinka erganjuwwa, Sihaaxxe, Hasuufaxxe, Xebi'ootixxe sannenaa'n <verse eid="NEH 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />Keeraasixxe, Si'axxe, Fadoonixxe, <verse eid="NEH 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />Libaanaxxe, Hagaabaxxe, Semilayixxe sannuwwanaa'n, <verse eid="NEH 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />Hananixxe, Gideelixxe, Gahaarixxe sannenaa'n, <verse eid="NEH 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />Kerayaxxe, Re'aasoonixxe, Niqoodaxxe sannuwwanaa'n, <verse eid="NEH 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />Gaaseemixxe, Oozaxxe, Faasihaxxe sannuwwanaa'n, <verse eid="NEH 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />Beesayixxe, Mi'uunixxe, Nifaaseesimixxe sannuwwanaa'n, <verse eid="NEH 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />Baaqibuqqixxe, Haqufaxxe, Harihuurixxe sannenaa'n, <verse eid="NEH 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />Baatsiliiti, Mihida, Harshaaxxe sannenaa'n, <verse eid="NEH 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />Baariqoosi, Siisaara, Teemaaxxe sannenaa'n, <verse eid="NEH 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />Nisiya, Haxiifaxxe sanuwwanaa'n. <verse eid="NEH 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Solomoonike erganjuwwixxa sannuwa, Sooxayixxa, Sofeereetixxenna Firuudaxxa sannuwwa, <verse eid="NEH 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />Ya'iilaxxa, Dariqonixxa, Gideelixxa sannuwwa, <verse eid="NEH 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />Sefaxiyaasixxa, Haxiilixxa, Fekiraatixxa Hatseeboyimixxanna Amoonixxa sannuwwa. <verse eid="NEH 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Woyyichchi Galmiink erganjuwwanna Solomoon'a ergatemaammake mannixxi sannuwwa, 392 temman.<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Konneechchi butta hedheekiir Telmeelake qachchinaa'n, Qilaareesi'n, Kerubi'n, Adoonaa'ninna Imeerii'n hingeeki kaddo malee sanne insa'neexxi Isira'eelixxe sanne kaddeexxa ca'a asse kula dandeeba'a. <verse eid="NEH 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Delaayaxxi, Xoobiyaxxi, Neqoodaxxi sannuwwa 642 temman.<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63-64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63-64" />Konnechchinn butti'a hexxeexxi horte edike ifike annuwwixxa ilatika daalo kula dandeeteba'a; insa'nenna Ebiyaxxi, Haqoosixxinna, Berizilaayixxe horten; qeesetixxe hortenaa'n kadeek Berizilaayi edi woddi anni Gele'adichcho Berizilaayixxe hortenaa'n mitte belto adhdheeman; tennenaa'n kexxeexxa aretike annixxe gosake summinni ye'eme; kunni insa'neek edki annuwwi ifi ifika ila ilatika daalo kula dande'a gonpheemmaxxe qeesummati ergatemmabaashsha hoyyemme.<verse eid="NEH 7:63-64" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Tennexxee ardiink galchalli Uriiminna tumiimiti uudaak qeesichchi afemaa qico'n insa'ne hara woyyitte ita indabaashsha ajaje.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Ard duuchchiki lakkoossi 42,360 kemmani, <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />Konne 7,337 labballiinkinna melaalletiki erganjuwwi gadhi darre 245 labballinna melaalle farsaleeyyetemmani. <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />736 fadhado, 245 gaange. <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />435 gaaluwwanna 6,720 harruwwanna hexxemmani.<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Mitte mitte mini hadiki annuwi hujetee buusa buunseeni; arda galchaammaki 8 kiilo graame worqe, 50 feritte diste, 530 qeesetixxa seemma uwwe. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Mitti mitti mini hadiki annuwwina mitti mitti 168 kiilo graame worqe, 1,250 kiilo graame birret sibljo uune. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Gateeki ard duuchchi uuwwexxi uuwa 168 kiilo graam worqe 140 kiilo graame birretika sibljonna 67 qeesetixxa seemma uune.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Qeese, Leewwito, hula heqqammaki heqqanjuwwi, faarsaaleeyyenna Galmi giddo ergataammaki erganjuwwi, ardakenaa'ninna weli manninna gatteexxi Isra'eelito ifi ifinge qachchuwwa'n ofolle.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:73 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:2">1 Odo. 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 11:3">Neh. 11:3</ref>. </char></note></para>
  <para style="s1" vid="NEH 7:73">Izira Seeriinka Maxaafa Haasoosse</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:73">Torbak agenji geye wodda Isira'eelito duuchcha ifi ifinge qahchcuwwa'n ofolde.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Ardi duuchchi Wodiinxe Hula edigama hedheeke ba'linna'ni mitte manjishsha bukki hine; ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Isira'eeli'a ajajemmaka Muuseke seerika maxaafa borreessanji Izira iyyedago'a kulle.<verse eid="NEH 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Tennexxe qeesichchi Izira torbake agenjixxe takkaaxxe barra'n laballi, melaallena wele galchedha dande'aaki duuchchi hedheeba ard edo seeriinka maxaafa iyyedaage. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Isinna «Wodiinxe hula» edidarre hedheeke ba'linniba alba wirri hiyyexxi; labballo, melaallenna wele galchedha dande'aake manni duuchchi edo urreexxi gorsii'n saafo'i qico'n haafura gikki asseexxi haaseesse; ard duuchchi seeriinka maxaafa sammi hiyyeexxi caqase.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Borreessanji Izira tenne'ni qephphi assende ijaarendeexxe medireke hana uurreemani; isi biranna middi darre'n Metitiyya, Shema'i, Anaya. Uuriya, Kelqiyaasi, Me'iseeya, bita'i darre'n kinn Fedaaya, Misa'eeli, Melikiya, Hashuumi, Hashibaadanahi, Zekkariyasinna Mesulaami uurrineemmani.<verse eid="NEH 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Iziranna maxaafa bane; qephphichcha booncho'n uurreemmaxxee duuchchiingi isoo uda'nemmani; maxaafa banee woddanna ard duuchchi ke'e uurre. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Iziranna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Lumoka Mageno galateeffatte; ardi duuchchinna anga iimi'a ke'isseexxi «Hami'n! Hami'n!» hiyyaamman; ookkoneechchi uduma albki buttinake'n gonbisemeexxi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta sagande.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Konneechchinni butti'a hexxeexxi Leewwito Iyyaasu, Baani, Seeraabiya, Yaamini, Aquubi, Sabatayi, Hoodiya, Me'iseeya, Qolxaasi, Azariyaasi, Yozabaati, Hanani, Feeliya ardi ookkoo uurreshshanni hedhee'na'a seera insa'ne'a barrise. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Insa'nenna haasoossinemmaka Mageniinka seeriinka maxaafa ardi ege'na dande'ashsha haaseseechchi uduma insa'ne'a mitte mittenda ardake tinka'ni barrinseemman.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Ookkoneechchi uduma arda galchaammaki Nehimiya, borreesanji qeesichchi Izira, ardakanna barsiisaammakki Leewwito insa'ne, «Tinni barra Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Mageno ha'nooke woyyitte barra'n kaddeemmaxxee yaaddinoqqe, ooxxinoqe'e» hine. Ard duuchchi seeriinka hiyyichcho lanqaamma wodda oo'na'nemmani.<verse eid="NEH 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Nehimiyanna insa'ne, «Me'itine eloxxa ita ittine, xe'mitaaxxa ha'wa ha'witine gammadde; mittelchchonna qophpheessedhebaake manni'a afineengenaa'n insa'ne'a qooddine erge, Tinni barra Gootta no'oke woyyitte barra'ni; Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxi gammashsho jabeenna ha'nookee kaddeemmaxxee yaaddinoqqe'e» hiyye.<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Leewwito, «Tinni barra woyyitte barra kaddeemmaxxe sammi hiyye; yaaddinoqqe» hiyyoti arda sammi assite.<verse eid="NEH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Tennexxe ard duuchchi'a hiyyemeeki hiyyichchi ageemmaxxee, jila jille gammanda'n indo'a, ha'wino'a, ita ifixxenaa'n qoonde ergno'anna me'ine.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Agenjiinxe langaxxe barra'n shiqi shiqike firik akeekisanjuwwi, seeri hiyya'neexxa baranto'a qeesetinna Leewwitto welti borreessanjo Izira qarqara bukki hine. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Isira'eeli torbake agenjo'n ulfeessinaaka ayyaana fooqi giddo ofolle ulfeessinaashsha Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Muuse gamii'ni uuweeka ajaja seeri giddo borreesseme'na anfe. <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />Tennexxe ifi ifike qachcha qachcha'ninna Iyyerusaalemi konnee hiyyichcho lallabaashshanna lassinaashsha hiyyee qici, «Tullichchuwwinba'a marre; zayitetikanna gamoojjeke ejersanaa'ni, Baarsineeti hanaaxxe, meexxetena'ninna shafi callixxe haqqexxa damoole iyyedange; ha'noonna borreessendeexxe aaddanni fooquwwa ijaarre» hiyye ajaje.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33-36">Lew. 23:33-36</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Tennexxe ard fuleexxi damuwwa iyyedage, mitti mittingi mine mine ifingixxe heelichchoxxe xelleephphon, ifi ifinxe baxxe'n, Mageniinke minike ba'linna'n, «Wodi'inxe hulake» ba'lina'ninna Efireemixxe hulake ba'linna'n fooqo ijaare. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Booji'otenaa'n higeemmaki ard duuchchi fooqo ijaareexxi giddo ofo'le. Neweke beltike Iyyaasuke baronaa'n ettene yanna qico'n Isira'eeli iitta assite ayyaana ulfeessite egendebaani; lumo qiconna gammandeen.<verse eid="NEH 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Siretixxe barranaa'n muuxamini qico'n, Izira barra barra'ninni Mageniinke seerika maxaafa haaseessa'nemmani. Insa'nenna ayyaana torbaane barra ulfeessine; saddeetixxe barra'ninna seeriinshshani muuxamiinxa bukki'i assine.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Isra'eelito Cubbo Ifixxa Faacite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Ookkone agenjixxe lame tommena shoole barra'n Isira'eeli agabo goddo hexxe jooniya seemma odo'wite umo ifike'n buko fiffilxite mitteba bukki hite. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Sanne Isira'eelixxe kadeeki duuchchi alagi gidi'n fule uurreexxinna ifixxe cubbo'anna annuwi insa'neekixxe balleessa'a aadde aange. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Insa'nennna he'ne he'neeba uurrineexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootta insa'neeke Magenike seerika maxaafa sase saate haaseessine gatteexxa sase saate kinni aadde anga'ninna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Mageno ifike kumbu hine. <verse eid="NEH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Leewwito hadhisanjoke'n hana uurrineemman; insa'nenna Iyyaasu, Baani, Qadimi'eeli, Seebeeniya, Buunni, Seeraabiya, Baaninna, Kenaani Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ifika Mageno haafura gikki assine kadhante. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Iyyaasu, Qadimi'eeli, Baani, Hashebaaniya, Seeraabiya, Hoodiya, Sebeniyanna Fetaya hiyyendaaxxi Leewwito: «Kexxineexxi uurre; duuchchi woddanna duuchchi woddi'a hedha'neeka Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ha'nooka Mageno saadde» hine.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 9:5" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 9:5">Ulfeessemeeki summi atiki galateeffatemmeeke kado'o; galata duuchchana'ninna saadinoti iimi darree lummedhowwaali. <verse eid="NEH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Atinni calli Duuchchi Woddike Goottani. Iimuwwa, iimuwwati iima hexxeexxa iimuwanna urjuwwatika sannaachchuwwa duuchcha, buttatanna ise'n hedheechcho duuchcha, abbaayyuwwatanna ise giddo hedheechcho duuchcha daddeetten. Duuchhiinge hedho uutaatten; iimi sannaachuwwi ati'a kumbu hiyyaan.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Abiraamii'i fildettexxi Keledaawitotixxe Uurinaa'n fulchitettexxi Abirihaamii hite summa fulchitetteki ati Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Magenoni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31-12:1">Dada. 11:31—12:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:5">17:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Mitte godobinni atee addateeke kadee'naa uuddettaxxi Kenaanitotika, Hittotika, Amooritotika, Feerizaawitotika, Iyyaabusitotika Gergerisiitotika boga sanne isixxee uutottaa isinni welti kako aaggeetteni; qullichcha kaddettaxxee'e isi'a addachchiissettaxxa asiteetteni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18-21">Dada. 15:18-21</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />«Ati Gibtseke boga'n annuwa no'oke'n gelteexxa rakko uddeeteni; Diimmoxxe Abbayya'ninna raare insa'neexxa laqqetteni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Fula. 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:1-12">14:1-12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Maso mambe'anna beessisuwwa Feri'ooni'ninna Jalqabuwwa isike duuchcha'n, bogake'n hedheeke arda duuchcha'n ergiteetteni; tenneenna assitetteki Gibtseki manni holla'n insa'nee hitta rakkiseexxa egendeettaxxeeteni. Telchi qico'ninna summi atiki ye'ema'n hedhaashsha assiteetteni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:8-12:32">Fula. 7:8—12:32</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Bagoke buttinanaa'ni fonfaashsha abbaayya lameba insa'ne edii'n qooddetteni; insa'nee shorraamaki kinni lumoke wodii giddo darbinaamaake kinjishsha insa'ne dhi'mo giddi'a darbitetteni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-29">Fula. 14:21-29</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:4-5">15:4-5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Me'inaaka ora barra duumanchik, hashsha giirati insa'nee akeekketeni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Fula. 13:21-22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />«Siinaxxe kooba'ninna dirritetteni; iimate'n hexxe insa'ne'a haasottetteni. Hasisaaka galdumanna qullichcha seeruwa, eloxxa aaduwanna ajajuwwa insa'ne'a uutetteni. <verse eid="NEH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Woyychcha atika Edi Eanbata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edi Sanbata hiyyendexxi barra Ayihudiinxe hafuura adhdhatixxe barranni</char></note> insa'ne'a ege'nishshetteni; ajajuwwa, adduwwatanna seeruwwa erganjo atike Muuse gamii'n insa'ne'a uutetteni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:18-23:33">Fula. 19:18—23:33</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Solo'winee wodda iimii'n maanna insa'ne'a uutetteni; dheebo'nee wodda rassatenaa'n wode'e burqissetteni; insa'ne'a uutotta'a anga farri assitete kakattetteke boga'n e'yine 'lallo'a kuldetten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4-15">Fula. 16:4-15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:21">Lan. 1:21</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />«Insa'nenna, annuwwi no'oki knn hollaameeyyetenna gooba micciirre ajajuwa atikanna ajajemmebaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-4">Lak. 14:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:26-33">Lan. 1:26-33</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Insa'neexxe oddo'n hujeteke mannibe'aanna masso laqiyyonna qalbeeffata dandeennebaani. Gooba miiciidhdhine; ajajema gophati garbummatibaa hingo'a insa'nee akeekaaka baalloonse. Ati kinni gattowwaalitiki Mageni, ba'lakinna mararanji, mufetee mudandaboxxokinna gattowwaali atixxi bira saxxeekeni. Tennexxee insa'nee waaldeboxxoni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Fula. 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Lak. 14:18</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />Jabbetixxa fakke baqinse ifi'a giisse'ne, ‹Gibtse'n atee fulcheeki mageni konneteni,› hiyyoti ate summa luqqicha yowwinsee wodda midde insa'nenaa'n gargarti higgeboxxoni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1-4">Fula. 32:1-4</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />«Atixxe marartexxe bira sa'nenaa'n kexxeexxa qiilla gammoojje'n insa'nee waaldeboxxoni; me'inaaka ora barra duumanchi hashshanna giirat akeeka waldebexxo. <verse eid="NEH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Insa'nee barsiiso'a eloka atika Haafura insa'ne'a uutetteni; maanna afo'o insa'neekenaa'n hoyyiteboxxoni; dheeboonne wodda wode'e insa'ne'a uutetteni. <verse eid="NEH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Qiilla gammoojje giddo shoole tomme wogga insa'nee itissetteni; mittichchi gonpheechchi hedhemmabaani; seemma insa'neexxinna muddeemmabaani; lekka insa'neexxinna darshiteemmabaani.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />«Gosa gosaxxe mootummuwwa injifanteexxi boga insa'neeka gabalatenaa'ni gabalati qico'n dhaallashsha assitettexxi; Haseeboniki moyanji galchaa'neek Siihoonika boga, Baasaanike moyanji galacha'neka Oogika boga dhaalle.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Lak. 21:21-35</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Labbaxxa oose iimixxe urjeshsha insa'ne'a bira sa'issitetteni; annuwwi insa'neeki dhaallaashsha kuldetteke boga'n dange e'yinaashsha assitetteni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Dada. 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Iya. 3:14-17</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Bogake'n labbaaxxi oose insa'neexxi e'yite, dhalde. Bogake'n hedhaammaka Kenaanika manna insa'nee edo guluffachchiissetteni; eeneeshsha assino'a Kanaanika moyanjuwwa insa'neeke boga'n hedhaammake ardinni welti anga insa'neexxe'n sa'issite uutetteni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:23">Iya. 11:23</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Dalla'iki buqemeeka qachchuwwanna shamoka boga abixxine; elollichchi calli wo'meeka minuwwa insa'neeka, umme fulchineeka baletika wodu'uwwa insa'neeka, woyinetika hiddichchuwwa insa'neeka, ejersiinxa haqquwwanna lakkoonne dhaqqanbabaaxxa gumma ra'isaaka haqichchuwwa adhdhine. Godinaa qico'n inde; furdante; arjunte atixxe'n gammande.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:10-11">Lew. 6:10-11</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />«Yaane kinn ajajema ginbe; ate'ninna jallante; seera atikanna ginbe; atiba'a hingo'a xexxe'achchisseexxa wabeeko atixxa shinne; ate'n fuggoka yowwichchiinka haaso'a fulche'ne. <verse eid="NEH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Tennexxe naaphi insa'ne rakkiso'a sa'issite uutetteni. Rakkantee wodda atibaa raarre; atinna iimanni hexxe laqqetteni; mararte atixxixxe bira sa'nenaa'n kexxeexxa naaphiinxe angana'n insa'nee anjiraakara ergitetten.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />«Yaane kinni nage'a alfinee wodda, ati edo elobaaxxa yaane higeenna hunje. Ookkoneechchi uduma insa'ne'n moyo'a naaphiinxe anga'n insa'nee ibissetteni; higgeenna atibaa raarree wodda, iimanni hexxe laqqetteni; mararte atixxenninna yanna yana'nini anjiriteteni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-16">Hay. 2:11-16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />«Seera atikibaa hingo'a xexxe'achchiissetteni; insa'ne kinni hollaameeyyete kande. Ajajuwwa atikanna muunxebaani; mitti manji isi'a ajajemeechcho kaddeele hedhoti hedhaammaka seeruwwa sa'ne. Ajajema ginbe dudduro ate'n wirri hine; goobakanna miciidhdhine; laqatanna ginbe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lew. 18:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Heddo baro insa'ne'a ossitetteni; wabeekoti darree'n Haafuri atikenni insa'ne xexxe'achchiissetteni. Yaane kinni lanqebaani; tennenaa'n kexxeexxa olla'a insa'neeke'n hedheeke gosa gosake ardixxe anga'n insa'nee sa'issite uutetteni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:13-18">2 Moy. 17:13-18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:15-16">2 Odo. 36:15-16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Ati kinni arjakenna marartaattoke Mageno kadeettaxxee gattowaali atixxixxe bira sa'nenaa'ni kexxeexxa, hara insa'nee birteboxxoni; insa'nee waaldeboxxoni.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />«Ta'anna no'oke Mageno, aggeettaxxa kakonna duuchchi woddixxa atixxa jaalala heqqexxattoki lumoki, hunnameessinna sodaatendeetteke Mageno; Asoorike moyanjuwwike baronaa'n ke'issite techchi qico'n no'oke; moyanjuwwa'ninna akeekisanjuwwa no'oke'n, qeese no'oxxe'ninna wabeeko no'oxxe'n, edike annuwwa no'oke'ninna arda atike duuchcha'n tennee gelteexxa rakko duuchcha shollaaxxe assite uuddoxxe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:19">2 Moy. 15:19</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:3-6">17:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 4:2">Izr. 4:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 4:10">10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />No'oo xixxe assitettexxi duuchchi seeraken; no'o balleessanoteni; ati kinni addatensha atixxenninni hexxetten. <verse eid="NEH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Moyanjuwwi no'oki, akeekisanjuwwi no'oki, qeese no'oxxinna edik annuwwi no'oki seera atika heqqe'nebani; ajajuwwa atika yookaani xexxe'achchiissettexxa lanqebaani. <verse eid="NEH 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />Insa'neeke moyanjuwwi'a, assitettexxa lumoxxa arjuntenna insa'ne'a qophpheessitetteke ba'lakenna shamoke boga'n midde, ati'a ergantebaani; fuggoke ora insa'nekenaa'ninna hingebaani.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />«Kunniseteni techchonna no'o garboolendeni; annuwwi no'oki isixxa gummuwwa fulchiteechcho elo elochcho indo'a insa'ne'a uuteettake boga'ninni garboolete kandenneni. <verse eid="NEH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Cubbo no'oxxenaa'n kexxeexxa bogi fulcheechcho duuchcha no'o'ni moyaashsha assite ke'isiteeteke moyanjuwwi'a uutetten; insa'ne no'o'ninna hore no'oke'ni eeneexxa duuchcha assina'neen; tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa no'onna jabake abara giddo he'nenneni.<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ardiinxa Weli Aaggo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />«Tenne duuchchanaa'n kexxeexxa no'onna borro borreesendee'naa eeyyunteti weli aangaanneni; akeekisanjuwwi no'oki, Leewwito no'oxxinna qeese no'oxxi maxxansa ifika itt ugite.»<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Ookkone weli aaggotike borreessa'n maxxansa uggeekiri konnechchinni butti'a hedheekeran;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 10:1">Ardiink galchalli Hakaaliyyaki belti Nehimiya, Sedeqiyaasi,<verse eid="NEH 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Seeraya, Azaariyaasi, Ermiyaasi,<verse eid="NEH 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Faaskoori, Amareya, Melikiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Haxuushi, Sebenya, Meluuki,<verse eid="NEH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Hariimi, Merimooti, Abdiyu,<verse eid="NEH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Daani'eli, Ginetoni, Baarooki,<verse eid="NEH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Mesulaami, Abiya, Miyaamini,<verse eid="NEH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Me'aziya, Biligayi, Shemaya, tinni konnechchi iima kulendeexxi qeesoluwwatemmani.<verse eid="NEH 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Leewwitotenaa'n konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxe</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 10:9">Azaaniyaki belti Iyyaasu, Henadaadixxe labbaxxe oosenaa'n Biiniwwi, Qadimi'eeli,<verse eid="NEH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />Dayyuwwi insa'neeki, Sebaniya, Hoodiya, Qoliixaasi, Feeliya, Hanani,<verse eid="NEH 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Mika, Re'aabi, Hashabiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Zekkuri, Seeraabiya, Sebeniya,<verse eid="NEH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hoodiya, Baani, Beeniinu.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Ardiinke akeekisanjuwwanaa'n konnechchinni butti'a hedheeke:</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 10:14">Faaroosi, Fehaaqimo'aabi, Elaami, Zaatu'i, Baani,<verse eid="NEH 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buuni, Azigaadi, Bebaayi,<verse eid="NEH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adooniya Bigiwwayi, Adiini,<verse eid="NEH 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Axeeri, Hiziqiyaasi, Azuuri,<verse eid="NEH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hoodiya, Hashuumi, Bedaayi,<verse eid="NEH 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Hariifi, Anaatooti, Nobayi,<verse eid="NEH 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Megiphi'aasi, Mesulaami, Hezi'eeri,<verse eid="NEH 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Mesezeebeli, Saadooqi, Yaatsu'i,<verse eid="NEH 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Felaaxiya, Hanani, Anaya,<verse eid="NEH 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hoosse'i, Hanaaniya, Hashuubi,<verse eid="NEH 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Haloheesi, Feliha, Sobeeqi,<verse eid="NEH 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Rehuumi, Hashabina, Me'iseeya,<verse eid="NEH 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Akiya Hanani, Anaani,<verse eid="NEH 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Meluuki, Hariimi, Be'aanna.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Gateeki wele ardi, qeese, Leewwito, hula heqqaammaki heqqanjuwwi, faarsaaleeyye, galmiinki erganjuwwi, Mageniinke seeri'a hiyyeexxi olla'ake'n hedheeke gosa gosake ard giddii'ni ifi foyeek duuchchi, aruwwa insa'neexxi, labbaxxinna meyyaxxi insa'neexxi oose, ege'neekinna galchchedhaaki duuchchi, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />insa'nenna ifike dayyuwwinninna ifike Ja'laabuwwin welti mitteba Mageniinka erganjo Muuse gamii'n uwwemeeka Mageniinka seera, Gootta no'oke Magenika ajajuwwa galdumuwwanna aadauwwa duuchcha ajajema gonphoolenna assa gonphoole badinemmaashsha kakante.<verse eid="NEH 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />«Dubarra no'oka qarqara no'oke'n hedheeke gosa gosake ardi'a herunsiinsabo'noni; insa'neeka dubarranna labbaxxe no'oxxe oose'a aadhinsabo'noni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:16">Fula. 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:3">Lew. 7:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />«Olla'a no'oke'n hedheek gosa gosak ard edi sanbatixxa barra gurgudhdhatee miya yookaani midha aa'ne dangoole, edi sanbatixxa barra yookaan heene woyyitte barra'ninna insa'nenaa'n hidhdhinabo'noni. Torbaxxe torbaxxe wogga'n boga huccinabe'no liqeessineenneka liqa duuchchanna adhdha waallannoni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:10-11">Fula. 23:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:1-7">Lew. 25:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 15:1-2">Lew. 15:1-2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />«Wogga wogga'ninni Mageniinke minixxe huje'a kaddaxxa 5 kiilo graama birreti sibljo uunonnaa kakantenne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Fula. 30:11-16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />Tinninna Xarabbeezake'n shiqqaaxxa daabo, duuchchi wodda shiqqaaxxa midhatixxa uwwa, ciincatika tolcha, edike sanbatixxe barra'ninna haaroxxe baate fulatike ayyaana'ninna muremeeke ayyaanuwwa'n shiqqaaxxe uwwaara, woyyichcha tolchuwi'a, Isira'eelixxe cubbo'a biratee shiqaaka cubbotika tolchuwwanna Mageno no'okike minixxe huje duuchchi'a hosaake kadaan.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />«No'o qeese, Leewwitotinna ardi wogga wogga'ninni murendemmashsha seerake'n borreessendemma qicinni, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta no'oke Magenike tolchimalcho'n ha'yishendaaxxa heqqe no'o mitti mittingik mini hadi haano Mageno no'okike minibaa iyyedagiyyo hasissaaxxa murronnaa hixa ibirsinenneni.<verse eid="NEH 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />«Midha no'xxika umonna no'oke mitti mitti haqichchixxe gummaka umo Mageniinke minibaa iyyedangannon.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:19">Fula. 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:26">34:26</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:2">Lew. 26:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NEH 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />«Ittanni seerake'n borreesendemmashshanni edise ilendeexxa labbaxxa no'oxxa oose, edise ilemeeka lalo no'oka, gedhebo no'okanna re'e no'oxxa Mageno no'okike mine'n, ergatenda'neexxe qeesebaa iyyedanganno.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Fula. 13:2</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="NEH 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />«Iti lenbennexxi bulle, no'oxxa midhatika tolcha no'aka, haqichchiinxa gumma duuchcha, harooka woyinetika bulbulonna zayituwwa umiinxa uwwa qeesetibaa Mageno no'okike miyuwiinke minuwwibaa iyyedangannoni. No'o hunjannoke qachchuwwa duuchcha'n hexxeexxa uuwwa bukki assaaki Leewwitotike kadeemmaxxe, midha no'oxxixxa tommitte Leewwitotinbaa iyyedangaanneni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Lak. 18:21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Qeese tommitte aaxxaa wodda Aaroonixxe sannenaa'n ilemeeki qeesichchi Leewwitoti welti hedhuun; eettene tommitte bukki assendemmaxxenaa'n Leewwito tommekenaa'n mitte anga Mageno no'okike miyuwiinke minuwwa'n tuullammaba iyyedangaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:26">Lak. 18:26</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Isira'eeliki ardinna Leewwito, midhatenaa'n, Harooxxe woyyinetixxee bookana'ninna zayitetenaa'n a'neeka, galmiinka miyuwwa massinamaba, ergataammaki qeesichchi, hula heqqaammakirinna faarssaalleeyye hexxaammabaa miyuwwiinke minuwwibaa iyyedangowwaali.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 10:39">«No'onna Mageno no'okike mini'aa hara ga'ma'm hinabe'non» hine.<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Harooba Iyyerusaalemi Hedhaammaka Arda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Ookkone wodda ardiinki akeekisanjuwwi galduma ifika Iyyerusaalemi giddo asse'ne; gateeke ardanaa'n tomme anganaa'n mitte anga woyyichcha Iyyerusaalemike qachcha'n, gatteexxi sallane anga kinn ifi ifinge qachchuwwa'n he'naashsha hixa ibirsine. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Ardikinna Iyyerusaalemi hedhdho'a ifixxe fedhinni ke'eka manna duuchcha galateeffante.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Yooni Iyyerusaalemi ofo'leeki qachchi akeekisanjuwwi konnechchinni butti'a hedheeni, ettene yanna'n Yihudiinke qachchuwwa'n hedhemaki heenoki Isira'eelooti, qeesole, Leewwitoti, galmiinki erganjuwwinna Solomoonike erganjuwwixxi sannuwwa mitti mittingi gargaritti hedheeke qachchuwwa'n hedheeke ifi ifinge geeguwwa'n ofo'le.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:73">Neh. 7:73</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />Yihudakenna Biiniyaamixxe gamo kadeek weli manni Iyyerusaalemi ofo'le.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:4" />
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 11:4">Yihudiinxe sannenaa'n:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:4" />
  <para style="mi" vid="NEH 11:4">Fareesixxe sannenaa'n Mahalaali'eelik belti, Sefaaxiyaasiki belti, Amaariyak belti, Zekkariyasiki belti, Oziyaki belti Ataaya, <verse eid="NEH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />Seeloxxe sannenaa'n Zekkariyasiki belti, Yeyyoraabiki belti, Hazayaki belti, Ozayaki belti, Kolihoozeeki belti, Baaruki belti Me'iseeya. <verse eid="NEH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Iyyerusaalemi ofoldeexxi Faaresixxi sannuwa duuchchi 468 worba mannammani.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Biinyaamixxe sannenaa'n:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:7" />
  <para style="mi" vid="NEH 11:7">Yashayaki belti, Iti'eelik belti, Me'iseeyaki belti, Qolayaki belti, Fedayaaki belti, Yo'ediki belti, Mesulaamiki belti Selu, <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />Iso'n itti anaaki Gaabayinnaxxi hortenna Salaayixxi horte 928 labballommani. <verse eid="NEH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Insa'neeki akeekisanji Zikirike belto Iyyu'eelite kadda wodda Hasenu'aki belti Yihuda qachcha langaba galchammakemmani.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Qeesetenaa'n:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:10" />
  <para style="mi" vid="NEH 11:10">Yida'iyaki belti Yeyuraabi, Yaakini, <verse eid="NEH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Mageniinke minki akeekisanji Ahixuubik belti, Merayootiki belti, Saadoqiki belti, Meesulaamiki belti, Hiliqiyaasiki belti Seeraya, <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />tenne gosanaa'n 822 Galmiinx hujeke erganjuwwamman; Melkiyaaki belti, Faskooriki belti, Zekkariyasiki belti, Amitsiki belti, Felaaliki belti, Yirohaamiki belti Adaya, <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />tenne gosanaa'n 242 shiqike firke akeekisanjuwa; Imeerik belti Mishilemooti Ahizaayiki belti, Ezeeri'eliki belti Amaasiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />Iittanni tennee gosanaa'n jajabbake kadeek 128 mannamman; Insa'neeki sooreessi Hagedoolimiki belti Zabidi'elitemani.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:14" />
  <para style="m" vid="NEH 11:14">Leewwitotenaa'n:<verse eid="NEH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Buuniinki belti, Hashebiyaki belti, Azirqaamiki belti, Hashuubiki belti Shamaya, <verse eid="NEH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Ittanni Mageniinke minixxa gadhi darreexxe huje'a akeekanoolete kandeemmaki, Leewwitotike akeekanoolenaa'n lami Sabatayinna Yozaabadi. <verse eid="NEH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Galatiinxenna soodachchotixxe yanna'n akeeka'n hedhemmaki taakkaki akeekisanji Asaafiki belti, Zabidiki belti, Miikaaki belti Metaaniya, tenne gosa gidi'n langake kadeeki Baaqibuqiyaki, Edotaamiki belti, Galaalki belti, Saamusiki beti Abdiya. <verse eid="NEH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Woyyichchi qachchi Iyyerussaalemi giddo he'nemmaki Leewwitotiinki laakkoosi 284 kemani.<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Hulatika heqqanjuwwa:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:19" />
  <para style="mi" vid="NEH 11:19">Aquubi, Xalmooninna insa'neeki firuwwi 172 mannammani.<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Gateeki Isira'eelootinna qeestinna Leewwitotiki welti Yihudiinke qachchuwwa duuchcha'n ifi ifinge geeguwwa'n ofolle.<verse eid="NEH 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Woyyichchi Galmiinki erganjuwwi Oofeelike tullichcha'n ofolle; Siihanna Giishpha insa'neeke akeekisanjuwwammani.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Iyyerusaalemi giddo Leewwitotiinki akeekisanji Miikaki belti, Metaaniyaki belti, Hashabiyaki belti, Baaniki belti Azitemmani; Azi Mageniinke mine'n faarsinaammaxxe faaro'a akeekisanjo kadeemmake Asaafixxe sannemmani. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Faarsaalleeyye barra barra'ninni shiqishshaaxxi faaro towataamake moyanjiinke ajajinnitemmani.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Yihudaki belti Zaarahixxe sanne kadeeki, Mesezeebeliki belti Fetaaya arda uuddaaxxe yane duuchchi'a moyanjiinxe tukkemman.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Yihudiinke ardanaa'n henooki olla'uwwake'ninna fichchuwwake'n; Qiriyaati Arbaaqinna qarqara iseke'n hedheeke minuwwa'n, Dibooni'ninna iseke minuwwa'n, Yiqebitsi'eeli'ninna isike ola'uwwa'n ofolle. <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />Ittanni Iyyaasu, Molaada, Beetiphaalexxinna, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />Hatsarishu'aali, Bersaabehina ifi fike qachchuwwa'n he'na'nemman. <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />Tsigilaagi'n, Mekoona'nnina qarara isike'n hedheeke olla'uwwa'n, <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />Ayiniriimooni'n, Tsooriyake'ninna, Yermuutike'n, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />Zaanohake'n, Adolaamike'ninna konne qachuwwa'n qarara hedheeke olla'uwwa'n he'na'emman; Lakishininna iseke qarqara'n hedheeke fichuwwi Azeeqanna isiki ollauwwi duuchchi insa'neeke galdumuwwamman; konne qicnni Yuhudake ardik galdumi bita'ii'ni Bersaabehi qioc'n middii'n Heenomixxe Dhooqa qico'n hexxeexxe kutamman.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Biniyaamike ardi galdumuwwi kinni Geba'i Makimaasi, Gayi'n, Beeteli'ninna qarqara isike'n afemaake olla'uwanitemman <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />Anatooti, Nobi Hanaaniya, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />Hatsoori, Raamanna Gitayimi, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />Hadaadi, Siboyiminna, Nibelaati, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />Loodinna, Oono, ittanni «Angatixxa ogeke mannixxe dhooqaa» hiyyeme ye'emaak boonchi duuchchi insa'neek galdumike boonchomman. <verse eid="NEH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Yihuda giddo hedhemmaki Leewwito heenooki Biiniyaamike boga'n ofolle.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Qeesoletanna Leewwito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Selaatiyaalike belti Zerubaabeelinna Iyyaasunni welti higgeexxi qeesenna Leewwito konneechchinni butti'a hedheeken;<verse eid="NEH 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Seraaliyya, Erimiyaasi, Izira, Amaariya,<verse eid="NEH 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Meluuki, Haxuushi, Sekeniya, Rehuumi, Meriimooti,<verse eid="NEH 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Iido, Ginetoon, Abiya,<verse eid="NEH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miyaamini, Me'adiya, Biliga,<verse eid="NEH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Shemaya, Yeyoraabi, Yida'iya,<verse eid="NEH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Selu, Amooqi, Hilqiyaasinna Yida'iya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 12:7">Insa'ne Iyyaasuke baro'n qeesetikenna dayyuwwa insa'neekike akeekisanjuwwammani.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Leewwito kinni Iyyaasu, Biniwwi, Qadimi'eeli, Seeraabiya, Yihuda, ittanni dayyuwwi ifikini welti galatiinxe faaroke akeekisanjo kadeeki Maataaniyatemmani. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Dayyuwwa insa'neeke kandeeki Baaqibuqiyanna Uniimi ergatemma wodda insa'neeke gama'n uurina'emmani.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umo Qeesichcho Iyyaasuxxa horte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Iyyaasu Yo'aaqimi'i i'le, Yoyaaqimi Eliyaashibii'i i'le, Eliyaasebi Yoyada'i i'le, <verse eid="NEH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoyada'i Yonaataani i'le, Yonaataaninna Yaadu'a i'le.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeesetixxe Gosaka Akeekisanjuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Yoyaaqimike baro'n qeesetike mini hadiki akeekisanjuwwi konnechchinni butti'a hedheekeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NEH 12:12">Serayake mini hadonaa'n, Miraya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NEH 12:12">Ermiyaasike mini hadonaa'n, Hanaaniya,<verse eid="NEH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Izirake mini hadonaa'n, Mesulaami,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 12:13">Amareyake mini hadonaa'n, Yihohaanaani,<verse eid="NEH 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Mulukike mini hadonaa'n, Yoonaataani,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 12:14">Sebenyake mini hadonaa'n, Yoosefi,<verse eid="NEH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Hariimike mini hadonaa'n, Adinna,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 12:15">Merayootike mini hadonaa'n, Helqayi,<verse eid="NEH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Adoke mini hadonaa'n, Zekkariyasi,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 12:16">Ginetonike mini hadonaa'n, Mesulaami,<verse eid="NEH 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Abiyake mini hadonaa'n, Zikir,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 12:17">Miniyaaminikenna Mo'aadiyake mini hadonaa'n, Felxxayi,<verse eid="NEH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Biligake mini hadonaa'n, Saamusi,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NEH 12:18">Shemayake mini hadonaa'n, Yonaataani,<verse eid="NEH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Yeyoraabike mini hadonaa'n, Metinayi, Yodaheke mini hadonaa'n, Aazi,<verse eid="NEH 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Salayike mini hadonaa'n, Qalayi, Amooqike mini hadonaa'n, Eebeeri,<verse eid="NEH 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Hilqiyaasike mini hadonaa'n, Hashabiya, Yodaheke mini hadonaa'n, Natina'eeli.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeesetikanna Leewitotike Mini Haduwwika Summuwwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Eliyaashibike, Yoyada'ike, Yohananikenna Yadu'ake baro'n Leewwitotinke mini hadiki akeekisanjuwwinna qeese, Faarsiki Daariyoosi moyeemmake baro'n borreessemeemmani. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Leewwitotixxe sannuwwa giddii'n Eliyaashibike beltika belto kadeeka Yonataani qico'n hedheeki mini miniki akeekisanjuwwi wabeekotike Maxaafi giddo borreeseemeemmani.<verse eid="NEH 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyyichcha Galm Giddika Ergatenshatika Qooddo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Leewwitotiki akeekisanjuwwi Hashabiya, Seeraabiya, Qedmi'eeliki belti Iyyaasutemmani; insa'nenna dayyuwi insa'neeki gama'n he'neexxi Mageniinki manji Daawwiti uwweemmaxxe akeetteshshani bado badoti adhdhina'ni galatakanna faaro shiqinsha'nemmani.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Woyyichcha Galmike dalla'iinxe huluwwa bira hedheeka miyuwwiinka minuwwa heqqaaki heqqanjuwwi kinni Metaaniya, Baaqibuqiya, Abdiyu, Mesulaami, Xalmooninna Aquubitemmani. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Insa'nenna Iyyooseedeqik belti, Iyyaasuki belti Yoyaaqimi, boga galchammaki Nehimiya, qeesichchonna seeriinka barsiisanjo Izirake baro'n ergatemme.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyerusaalemike Dalla'ixxe Eebbaka Ayyaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Iyyerusaalemika dalla'a eebbinse wodda Leewwito galatiinxe faaronni; bilbiliki, kiraarikinna masinqoti meellinni eebbatika ayyaana gammashshoti ulfeessino'a he'neeke bonchonaa'n hasemme Iyyerussaalemi'a dange. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Faarsaaleeyyetanna ittanni Iyyerusaalemi qarqara hedheeke Nexoofitotike ola'anaa'n mitteba bukki assine. <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />Insa'ne Iyyerusaalemike qarqara'n ifi'anni minuwwa ijaadhdhineemmaxxe faarsaaleeyye iyyedangeemmaki Beetigilgaali'ni, Geba'inna Aziimiti qarqari'niteni. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Qeesenna Leewwito seeriinshanni ifi ca'a assineechchi uduma arda, dalla'akanna huluwwa ca'a assine.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Aninna Yihudiinka akeekisanjuwwa kinjiinke dalla'i hana sa'naashsha assenneni; higeenna galata shiqinsho'a lame jajabba faarsaalleeyyetika qorba qophpheesseenneni. Mitte gamo kinjiinke dalla'i hana middi darree'n «Kora Hunnammaxxe hula» hinaammaba me'ite. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Insa'ne'a Hoshaa'iyakinna Yihudiinke akeekisanjuwwik gamisi insa'neexxa duuka me'ineeni; <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />Duuka insa'neexxa me'ineerikinna Azariyaasi, Izira, Mesulaami, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Yihuda, Biiniyaami, Shemaya, Ermiyaasinna; <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />ittani malagata abixxiteexxi heenoxxi qeesenna Asaafike beltinni, Zekkurike beltinni, Mikayake beltini, Metaaniyake beltinni, Shemayake beltinni, Yoonaataanike beltinni, Zekkariyasike beltini welti he'nemmani. <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />Dayyuwwi insa'neeki Shemaya, Ezeri'eeli, Milaalayi, Giilelayi, Me'ayi, Natina'eeli, Yihudanna Hanaani Mageniinki manji Daawwiti ajajemmashshanni faarotika miyyuwwa adhdhine me'ine; gogeessa akeekammakinna seeriink barsiisanji Iziratemmani. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />«Muummetixxe Hulabaa'n» ke'neexxi toggi hine'e Daawwitike qachchibaa qabante; ookkoo'ninna dalla'akenaa'n gadhi'a fullammaxxe hulabaa'n me'ineexxi Daawwitike mini aligamii'n boroti darre'n hexxeexxe wodi'inxe muummebaa me'ine.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Langaxxi faarsaaleeyyetik qorb bita'i darre'n me'ite; aninna gamisi ardinni welti hedhe kinjiinke dalla'anaa'ni Itoonika Dalla'a sa'eneexxi Ba'lake Dalla'i qico'n insa'neexxa duuka me'enneni. <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />Ookkoo'ninna Efireemixxe hula ali darre, dullatte hulabaa'n, qulxu'metixxe hula, Hanaani'eelike Dalla'ibaa'n, dhibba geltaaxxe hulabaa'n sa'e «Gedhebiinxe Hula» qico'n duuka insa'neexxa me'enneni. Insa'nenna «Heqqanjuwwiinxe Hula» bira genneexxi uurrine.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Konne qicinni galata shiqishsheexxi lamiinxi faarsaaleeyyetixxi gamuwwa Mageniinke mine'n booncho abixxine; aninna gamisi ja'laabuwwinni welti booncho abixxenneni. <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />Itanni qeesichchi Eliyaaqeemi, Me'iseeya, Miiniyaamini, Mikaya, Eliyo'eenayi, Zekkariyasinna Hanaaniya malagatuwwa abixxineexxi, <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />Me'iseeya, Shemaya. Ali'aazaar, Aazi, Yihonaani, Melikiya, Elaaminna Etseer bakka bakka abixxine; faarsaaleeyye Yizirhiyaxxe akeekisanjummanni faarsite. <verse eid="NEH 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Mageni insa'nee yo'oshsha gammandaashsha asseemmaxxee eettene barra gammanda'n heddo tolcha shiqinshe; melaallenna oose ittanni gammande; tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Iyyerusaalemi giddo hedheemmaki gammashotiki haafuri bayyi qico'n laqisa'nemmani.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woyyichchi Galmixxe Ergatensha'a Shiqqeexxa Uwwaara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Etenne barra'n uuwwa, midhatika umonna tommitte massinaaka miyuwwiinka mine heqqaaka manna hariirre. Insa'nenna qachchuwwi qachchuwwiinke qarqara'n hedheeka huccinaaka fichchuwwa seeri ajajaammashshanni qeesetikanna Leewwitotika qoobbo miya massinammake minibaa iyyedaga hasissaammani; Yihudiinki manni ergatenda'neexxe qeese'ninna Leewwitote'n gammande. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Insa'nenna Faarsaaleyyenna hula ookkone heqqammakaara, insa'neke Magenixxa aada ca'a assatixxa aada Daawwitinna belto isike Solomoonishsha ajaja heqqe'ne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 25:1-8">1 Odo. 25:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 26:12">26:12</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Edike baro'n Daawwitikenna Asaafike baro'n Magenokee shiqqaaxxa saadinotixxanna galatiinxa faaruwwa akeekkaammaxxe faarsaaleeyetike aakekisanjuwwaman. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Zerubaabelikenna Nehmiyake baro'n Isira'eeli duuchchi faarsaaleeyyetenna hula heqqaamake'ria barra barratika qoobbo uta'nemmani; wele Leewwitotika qoobbonna qofinni uggina'nemmani; Aaroonixxe sanne kadeeke Leewwitoti'anna geyaaka qoobbo insa'ne'anna uggina'nemmani.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nehimiya Isira'eelika Arda Alagaa Ardanaa'n Gargar Hiisse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Eettene barra'n Muuseka Maxaafa haafura gikki assineexxi ardi laqaa'na haaseessine; Amoonitonna kadi Mo'aabito Mageniinke ardixxe buki'n hara e'yinabaashsha hiyyaki borreesemeeki borreessi afemen; <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />Tinni kadeechchi Isira'eeli itatinna wodi'iki qophedhatixxa bakka, Bele'aami insa'nee badino'a maallaqiki hidhdhineemmaxxeeteni; kaddo male'e Mageni no'oki yowwichcho eebbate asse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:3-5">Lew. 23:3-5</ref>. </char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Lak. 22:1-6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Ardikinna konnee seera laqeexxa yanna, alagake kadeeka duuchcha Isira'eel giddii'n gargar hisse.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehimiya Asseexxa Haaronsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Edi wodda no'oke Magenika miyuwwiinke minike akeekisanjo kade'e hariiremeemmaki qeesichcho Eliyaashibitemmani; isinna Xoobiyanni welti jaba qicinni jaalomeexxi, <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />konnechchi edo midhatika tolcha, hixaana, galmiinka miyyuwa, midhatixxa uuwwanna, Leewwitotike, faarsaaleeyyetenna hula heqqammakeri'a ajajendeexxa haaroxxa woyinenna zayite qeeseteenna iyyedangaammaxxa uuwwa ugginaammaka lumoka miyiinka mine uwwemmani.<verse eid="NEH 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Tinn duuchchi kaddaa wodda ani Iyyerusaalemi hedheennabaani; yane kinni Arixxeekisiissi Baabiloonike moyanjo kadeechchinni sase tommenna langaxxe wogga'n moyanjiinbaa hige mareennani. Shiixxoxxe yanna uduma moyanjo eeti laqedhennexxi, <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />Iyyerusaalemi'a higenne; ookkonna Eliyaashib Mageniinke minike ba'linanaa'n Xoobiyaa mitte hedhaaxxa kutta uwweexxi hujeexxa elobaaxxa huje ege'nenne. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Aninna yo'oshsha yaadenneni; Xoobiyake mine'n hedheemmaka miya duuchcha kuta giddii'n gadhi'a fulchenne. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Kutuwwatanna ca'a assendo'a ajajenneni; ookkoneechchi uduma Mageniinke minka miyuwwa, midhatixxa uwwanna hixaaniki welti mini'a hiisse uggenneni.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Ittanni Leewwitotee uwwemaammaka qoobbo uuneemmabaaxxanna Leewwitotinna faarsaaleeyye insa'nee uuddaammaxxa ergatensha waaldeexi ifi fike fichchibaa me'iteexxa wo'me. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Tennexxe Ja'laabuwwa xixennexxi «Mageniinke minixxe huje'n ga'ma'm hitineechi mayeete?» hiyye insa'nee qorenneni. Ookko'ninni insa'nee mitteba bukki assennexxi insa'ne'a uwwendeemmaxxe huje huje'n hingaashsha assenneni.<verse eid="NEH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Yihudiinki manni duuchchi midhatika, harooxxe woyinekanna zayitetixxa tommitte miyuwiinke minibaa aassine. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Miyuwiinke minuwwi'a qeesichcho Selemiyanni, borreessanjo Saadooqinna Fedayate hinaaka Leewwichcho akeekisanjuwwake asse hariire hunjashsha assennene; ittanni Metaaniyaka belto Zekkurika belto Hanani'i tuke insa'neexxe assenne; yaane kinni kunn manni addatemeekemmani. Huje insa'neexxinna dayyuwwa insa'neekee geyaachcho qoodatemmani.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Anike Magenoo tenne yaane'a anee hedi; anike Mageniike mini'anna ergatenshatee hiyye addatenshati assennexxa balleessitoxxe.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Eettene barruwwa'n Yihudi giddo edi sanbatinxe barra'n woyine hirbeessat miicaaka, midha assedhakanna, woyinetixxa booka, woyinetixxa rodde, Balasetixxanna wele gargar gargar hexxeexxa ba'o duuchcha harrete'n fe'aaka manna uudenneni; konnechcho duuchcha Iyyerusaalemi'a e'inshaammaki edike sanbatinxe barrammani. Tennexxee eettenee barra ita gurgurrabaashsha insa'nee hoyyenneni. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Iyyerusaalemi hedhammaki Xiroosiki manninna Qulxxu'menna gargarti hedheechcho edike sanbatiinxa barra iyyedanga'n Yihudiinke ardi'a Iyyerussaalemi gurgura'nemnani. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Aninna Yihudiinke Ja'laabuwwa'n mufatenexxi hiyyenne qici, «Edika Sanbata battoonsitine tinni hujina'neexxi elobaaxxi huje maachcho? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Ediki annuwwi ha'nooki hujeexxi tennendemmaba? Mageni no'oki tenne ba'ne duuchcha no'o'ninna konne qachcha'n iyyedageechchi tenne ballessa no'oxxeeteba? Ta'anna ha'no edika sanbata battoonsati tennee saxxeexxa rakko Isira'eeli'ni iyyedaginaani» hiyyenneni.<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Soodi sanbatake hina'na'a Iyyerusaalemixxe huluwa'n bogi siphphi siphphi hiyyaamma wodda huluwwa cufendaashshanna, sanbati sa'aa qico'n banedabaashsha ajajenneni; edika sanbatinxe barra'n feenechchi e'yabaashsha anike mannanaa'n mitte mitte hula hula'n uurrisenneni. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Gargarti hedheeka miyuwwa daddaldammaxxi daddaltonna gurgudhdhaammakiri Iyyerusaalemi gadho mitte yookaan lame yanna galeeni. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Aninna kinni «Dalla'in gadho galdina'neechchi mayete? Iitta hexxeexxa yaane langaxxa assitinoole hunnati ha'no'ni ke'annoni» hiyye insa'nee xexxe'achchiisenneni; insa'nenna eettene yannanaa'n edike sanbatinxa barra dangebaan. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Ookkoo'ninna Leewwito ifi ca'a assexxe, marreexxi dalla'inxa hula heqqinashshanna sanbatiinxa barra woyyonsinashsha insa'nee ajajenneni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Ee, anke Mageno; tennexxe anee hedi; atixxe lumooxxe jaalalaxxe birasa'nenni ani'a gattoowwaal hiyyi.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Eettene barruwwa'n Ashidoodixxa, Amoonixxann Mo'aabitotixxa melaalle Ayihudiinka manna aadheexxa womenne. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Oose insa'nexxi giddii'n gamisi Ashidoodika, yookaani wele mannika laagada malee Yihudiinka laagada haaso'a dandeetaammabaani. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Aninna mufatennexxi insa'ne badine; iittanna xixenne; welekanna ganenneni; umo insa'neekanna fooxenne. Mageniinke summinni hiyya'n kakachchiisenne qici, «Dubarra ha'nooka insa'neexxe labbaxxe oose'a herunsiissinoqqe; dubarra insa'nekanna labbaxxe ha'nooxxe oose'n aadhissinoqqe. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Isira'eeliki moyanji Solomooni cubbo hujeeki iitta fakkattaaxxe aadhanaa'n kexxeexxebaa? Heddi moyanjuwwi giddii'n isishsha hedheeki moyanji hedheemmabaani; Magenoke'ninna eeyyemeekemmani; Mageninna Isra'eeli duuchcha'n moyanjoke asseeni. Yaane kinni alaga melaalle iso'o cubbote'n ibiseeni. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />Ha'noonna kinni alagiinxa melaalle aaxxine tenne fakkaattaaxxa lumoxxa balleessa hujine Mageno no'oke addatema gopha ha'nooxxa no'o laqiyyo hasissamma?»<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Qeesetike akeekisanjiki Eliyaashibiki belti Yoyada'ixxe oosenaa'n mitti Horoonichchi Senbalaaxik balli hedhemmani; aninna isoo ani birii'n shorrenneni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-16">Hay. 2:11-16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Ee, anike Mageno, kunni ardi qeesumma, qeesummatixxa aadanna ati Leewwitotee aaggeettaxxa kakko battoossineexxa uudi!<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Tennexxe qeesenna Leewwito alaga battummanaa'n ca'a hinaashsha assenne; mitti mittingixxa huje gargar foyeenexxi huje huje insa'neexxe'n uggenne. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Ani murendeexxe yanna'n bukki assinaaxxe giiratixxe haqqexxenna umiinxe midhaxxee'e seera uggenneni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Ee, anke Mageno elle atixxinni anee qaabbati.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>